      "text": "a committed fit made this exact revision · the question's outcome is a state\nevery intervention target's effect on it is identified\nthe fit used the particle engine with the Euler–Maruyama target\nand kept joint uncertainty · it passed its convergence checks\nthe paired histories are finite",
